cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "transient-dynamics: Emerging transient dynamics at finite observation scales"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and analyses for an observational framework that identifies the
  processes relevant to a finite observer, predicts switching thresholds and
  dynamic regimes, and compares an adaptive Boolean model that simulates only
  relevant processes with the full model, applied to phage-bacteria
  (Lotka-Volterra) dynamics with and without bacterial carrying capacity.
